# Optional, read-only Qatom capability probe. Never commit a real token.
QATOM_MCP_TOKEN=

# --- Optional provider settings (server-side only; never NEXT_PUBLIC_*) ---
# Qatom read-only MCP probe (npm run qatom:probe). QATOM_API_KEY is accepted as an alias.
# The endpoint is fixed to https://mcp.m.todaq.net/mcp in code.
# QATOM_MCP_TOKEN=
# Backboard: the API key alone is enough (createBackboardModel -> https://app.backboard.io/api, X-API-Key).
# Optional: BACKBOARD_LLM_PROVIDER (default openai), BACKBOARD_MODEL_NAME (default gpt-4o).
# Live model calls are still disabled in the web app until a numeric spend limit is approved.
# BACKBOARD_API_KEY=

# --- Vercel (Project Settings > Environment Variables) ---
# GATEWAY_BASE_URL must be the deployed gateway's HTTPS URL; loopback does not exist on Vercel.
# Set API_KEY_DASHBOARD, API_KEY_AGENT (distinct), API_KEY_ADMIN and DEMO_OWNER_ID there too.
